# Tracer: deterministic carrier composition at Direct, after object WD.
# Before:
# have n N
# ((n+1)+1)+1 $in N
# Former result: search_proof failed as each arithmetic layer consumed a level.
# have a,b cart(R,R)
# 0 <= (b[1]-a[1])^2
# Former result: predicate WD could not establish the squared difference in R.
# Now: the same goals verify without preliminary carrier facts.
have n N
((n+1)+1)+1 $in N
have a,b cart(R,R)
0 <= (b(1)-a(1))^2
have x,y R
0 <= (floor(x)-floor(y))^2
have t R
0 <= (sin(t)+cos(t))^2
have q Q
(q+1)*(q-1) $in Q
have z C
(z+1)*(z-1) $in C
